cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Moodify in research, please cite it as follows."
title: "Moodify — An open protocol and reference implementation for evolving audio intelligence"
abstract: >-
  An open protocol and reference implementation for evolving audio intelligence,
  built on an evidence-first auditory framework: real songs become reproducible,
  inspectable, versioned auditory production cases with standards-backed
  measurement, diagnosis-derived bounded interventions, deterministic
  algorithmic review, and pairwise evaluation data. Generated is not finished —
  human listening and release authority are retained, never delegated.
